  "description": "After years of toil and ridicule, one man finally found the Artifacts—remnants of a lost technology so advanced that they cannot be replicated. Several years later, that same man founded a criminal organization in Korea—the Daejung Syndicate. The man expanded his influence using five child soldiers he armed with Artifacts, and Gil-Ja is one of them. But Gil-Ja soon realizes that the Artifacts can free her of the syndicate entirely. However, this freedom comes with a steep price...\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
